{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-405782-r4587437","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Apple Bars","sourcePageId":405782,"sourceRevision":"4587437","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-10-26T23:36:03Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Codename Noreste","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Apple%20Bars&oldid=4587437","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:22:52.393Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baking recipes","Category:Easy recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using apple","Category:Recipes using brown sugar","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using grapefruit juice","Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon","Category:Recipes using ground ginger","Category:Recipes using lemon juice"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"0719a5161439f4defd7aa48c95d32685f1d41561b95bfbdd88040ee32f4360b7","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__\n{{recipe summary\n| category    = Recipes for dessert\n| servings    = Makes 4\n| time        = 1 hour\n| difficulty  = 2\n| image       = \n| energy      = \n| note        = \n}}\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Dessert|Dessert]] \n\n==Ingredients==\n===Base===\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (240 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]]) commercially-prepared baking mix or [[Cookbook:Biscuit Mix|biscuit mix]]\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Brown Sugar|brown sugar]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Ounce|ounce]] (30 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]] powder\n* ¼ teaspoon powdered [[Cookbook:Ginger|ginger]]\n* ¼ teaspoon ground [[Cookbook:Nutmeg|nutmeg]]\n\n===Topping===\n* 2 soft-textured [[Cookbook:Apple|apples]], sliced\n* 1 splash of grapefruit or lemon juice\n* ½ teaspoon cinnamon powder\n* ¼ teaspoon powdered ginger\n* ¼ teaspoon ground nutmeg\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] baking mix or biscuit mix\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] brown sugar\n\n==Procedure==\n\n=== Make base ===\n# Combine the baking mix, egg, brown sugar, and spices in a bowl.\n# Rub the butter into the base mixture with your fingers. The mixture should not be sticky.\n# Line an 8 by 8-inch (20 by 20 cm) baking pan with [[Cookbook:Parchment Paper|parchment paper]].\n# Press the base mixture into the bottom of the baking pan (you might want to press it up the sides a little).\n\n=== Prepare topping ===\n# Toss the sliced apples in the grapefruit or lemon juice, distributing the juice evenly.\n# Combine the cinnamon, ginger, nutmeg, baking mix, and brown sugar.\n# Toss most of the spice mix with the apples. Reserve the remaining spice mix.\n# Tip the lightly coated apples on top of the prepared base in the pan. Try to arrange the slices to have an even layer.\n# Sprinkle the remaining spice mixture on top of the apples.\n\n=== Bake ===\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to [[Cookbook:Oven_temperatures|375°F (190°C)]].\n# Bake for 30 minutes at 375°F (190°C).\n# After allowing it to cool, you can lift the slice out of the baking pan by the corners of the parchment paper and put it on a plate for easy slicing.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using apple]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Easy recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using grapefruit juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground ginger]]","isRecipe":false,"recipe":{"name":"Apple Bars","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":"Makes 4","ingredients":[],"steps":[],"nutrition":null,"gaps":["Research extraction only; no culinary/editorial review.","Ingredient quantities, units, alternatives, food identities, aggregate duration, and nutrition remain unknown until individually parsed/reviewed.","Source-level CC BY-SA policy applies generally; page-specific exceptions have not been checked."]}},"parsedRecipe":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"wikibooks:405782","recordId":"wikibooks-405782-r4587437","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceRevision":"4587437","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Apple%20Bars&oldid=4587437","sourceSha256":"0719a5161439f4defd7aa48c95d32685f1d41561b95bfbdd88040ee32f4360b7","parserVersion":"wikibooks-sections-v3","quantityParserVersion":"source-prefix-v2","license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"reviewStatus":"source-extracted-unreviewed","changeNotice":"Source-language section extraction; markup removed. Not culinarily reviewed, translated or runtime-approved.","recipe":{"name":"Apple Bars","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":"Makes